1023	     * note is used only as far as it was needed to settle its invoice once payments are counted; anything beyond
1024	     * that (say, a credit on an invoice already paid in full, or on one since cancelled) is still the client's to spend.
1025	     * Whatever has been refunded to the client is no longer theirs to spend.
1026	     */
1027	    @Transactional(readOnly = true)
1028	    public ClientCreditResponse available(Long clientId) {
